yaml/mapping
description: Keyed collection of key-value pairs
- >
  A **mapping** is a collection of key-value pairs. It comes in two concretes - the
  indentation-based block spelling and the braced flow one - and in either, the pair is a
  construct of its own. See the subchapters below:
- *: 00-yaml_mapping_block
- *: 01-yaml_mapping_flow
- *: 02-yaml_key_value_pair
